(text "RS485 SOIL SENSORS (two buses: the SMT100 is 8E1, the 7-in-1 8N1)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 20 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3e7decbc-709a-4551-8853-6045fcb9571f"))
(text "SP3485 (3.3 V, pin-compatible with MAX485) powered from +3V3_SW. Direction is automatic: TX idle-high turns the\nMMBT3904 on and holds DE/RE low (receive); a 0 bit releases DE so the driver pulls the bus low; 1 bits come from the\n4.7k bias. 10 R + SM712 protect the field cable. 120 R termination not fitted (short cable, 9600 baud).\nFirmware: set the TX pins low/input before switching +3V3_SW off, or they feed the unpowered chips." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 24 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ba58a961-e6b1-43fc-b96b-c4aad8033ccb"))
(text "SMT100" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 58 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "efe9dc8b-0a68-4232-a07a-adbed9874b95"))
